<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8"/>
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0"/>
  <title>Boise Gems Independent — Indoor Percussion</title>
  <%- include("includes/head") %>
  <meta name="description" content="Boise Gems Independent — launching our inaugural indoor percussion season. Join the very first cast.">
  <link rel="canonical" href="https://boisegems.org/independent">
  <meta property="og:title" content="Boise Gems Independent — Indoor Percussion">
  <meta property="og:description" content="Be part of our first-ever indoor percussion season in Idaho. Audition info, schedule, and more.">
</head>
<body style="background: #eee">
  <header><%- include("includes/header") %></header>

  <!-- HERO -->
  <section style="padding:16px 12px;">
    <div class="duple-to-single" style="align-items:center; gap:16px;">
      <div style="margin:4px;">
        <h1>Boise Gems Independent</h1>
        <p style="max-width:60ch;">
          We’re launching our <strong>first-ever</strong> indoor percussion season. This is your
          chance to help define the ensemble’s identity from day one—battery and front ensemble
          performers collaborating to create an impactful, theatrical production for the winter circuit.
        </p>
        <div style="display:flex; gap:8px; flex-wrap:wrap; margin-top:12px;">
          <a href="/register-member"><button>Audition / Join</button></a>
          <a href="/calendar"><button>Season Schedule</button></a>
          <a href="/donate"><button>Support the Launch</button></a>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div style="margin:4px;">
        <!-- Placeholder image (16:9) -->
        <div style="width:100%; aspect-ratio:16/9; background:#eee; background-image:url('/img/photos/boise-gems-23.jpg'); background-size:cover; background-position:center; border-radius:8px;"></div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- ABOUT THE INAUGURAL SEASON -->
  <section style="padding:16px 12px;">
    <div class="duple-to-single" style="gap:16px;">
      <div style="margin:4px;">
        <h2>The Inaugural Cast</h2>
        <p style="max-width:65ch;">
          As a founding member, you’ll set the culture, performance standard, and traditions
          that future seasons will follow. We’ll focus on achievable excellence—strong music
          vocabulary, engaging design, and a rehearsal experience that respects your time.
        </p>
        <ul style="margin:8px 0; padding-left:18px;">
          <li>Battery + Front Ensemble opportunities</li>
          <li>Local/Regional competitive schedule</li>
          <li>Collaborative design process and feedback loops</li>
        </ul>
      </div>
      <div style="margin:4px;">
        <div style="width:100%; aspect-ratio:4/3; background:#eee; background-image:url('/img/photos/boise-gems-09.jpg'); background-size:cover; background-position:center; border-radius:8px;"></div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- PROGRAM PILLARS -->
  <section style="padding:16px 12px;">
    <h2>Program Pillars</h2>
    <div class="triple-to-single triple-to-single-mod" style="gap:12px;">
      <div class="card" style="margin:4px;">
        <div style="width:100%; aspect-ratio:3/2; background:#eee; background-image:url('/img/photos/boise-gems-07.jpg'); background-size:cover; background-position:center; border-radius:6px;"></div>
        <h3 style="margin-top:8px;">Creative Design</h3>
        <p>Clear concept, smart staging, and pacing that highlights performer strengths.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="card" style="margin:4px;">
        <div style="width:100%; aspect-ratio:3/2; background:#eee; background-image:url('/img/photos/boise-gems-24.jpg'); background-size:cover; background-position:center; border-radius:6px;"></div>
        <h3 style="margin-top:8px;">Technical Growth</h3>
        <p>Learn and grow as musicians, refining technical skills and improving as performers</p>
      </div>
      <div class="card" style="margin:4px;">
        <div style="width:100%; aspect-ratio:3/2; background:#eee; background-image:url('/img/photos/boise-gems-09.jpg'); background-size:cover; background-position:center; border-radius:6px;"></div>
        <h3 style="margin-top:8px;">Healthy Culture</h3>
        <p>Respect, accountability, and fun. A place where people grow.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- CTA -->
  <section style="padding:16px 12px;">
    <div class="card" style="padding:16px;">
      <h2 style="margin:0 0 8px;">Be Part of Season One</h2>
      <p style="margin:0 0 12px;">Help write the first chapter of Boise Gems Independent.</p>
      <div style="display:flex; gap:8px; flex-wrap:wrap;">
        <a href="/register-member"><button>Create a Free Account</button></a>
        <a href="/contact"><button>Ask a Question</button></a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <footer><%- include("includes/footer") %></footer>
</body>
</html>
